<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cominco upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cominco upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it raised its intermediate-term rating on the shares of Canadian metal company Cominco Ltd to accumulate and its long-term rating on the stock to buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it previously rated Cominco's stock as neutral intermediate-term and accumulate long-term.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On the Toronto Stock Exchange, Cominco's stock was up C$0.15 at C$40.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
